    "directions": [
      "In a handi, add oil, mustard oil, once it's hot, add cinnamon stick, bay leaf, cloves, onions and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add mutton with bones and saute for a while until onions are cooked well.",
      "Add coriander powder, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder and cook it for a while.",
      "Add curd and cook for 5-6 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add water to adjust the consistency, cover it with a lid and cook it for 30-40 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Finish it with some prepared masala, salt to taste and cook for 5-6 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl or dish, garnish it with ginger, green chillies, coriander leaves & stems.",
      "Serve hot with roti or rice.",
      "In a pan, add black peppercorns, cloves, black cardamom, mace, cumin seeds, green cardamom, fennel seeds, coriander seeds, salt to taste and roast them for a while until it's aromatic.",
      "Transfer it to a tray, add carom seeds and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it smoothly.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
